Notes: OHLC = sb_data/qqq_ohlc.csv, 6784 sessions 1999-09-15..2026-09-04, all genuine (no o=h=l=c rows; h>=max(o,c), l<=min(o,c) always); closes identical to qqq_long_history.csv, which is the proxy panel's source (it holds only d,o,c), so the proxy panel also gets real H/L. The last 46 sessions (2026-09-08..11-10) have no H/L: no intraday triggers there (= V0).
Line = 1.02 x SMA200 with that day's own price in the SMA (solved exactly for the touch price). Fill = max(open,line) for entries, min(open,line) for exits. TQQQ/QLD = 3x/2x QQQ move, core (SPMO/QQQ) 1x. Extra return only on the trigger day; weights after the close = V0 close-based. False trigger pays 2 extra one-way trades. Intraday D needs price < 1.01 x SMA50, breadth gate read from prior close. VIXM/QQQ cash-leg slices not adjusted. V5 (E->D) is almost always subsumed by V1 because the 1% buffer sits under the 2% gate line.
